{
  "body": "<div class=\"page-wrapper\">\n<header class=\"nav_component\"><div class=\"nav_container\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#content\" aria-label=\"Tidewell Home, back to top\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"tidewell-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 25V14L24 5l16 9v11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"tidewell-wave\"><path d=\"M5 29c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0M5 38c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span>Tidewell<span class=\"brand-subtitle\">HOME</span></span></a><nav class=\"nav_menu\" id=\"primary-navigation\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"nav_menu-links\"><a class=\"nav_link\" href=\"#services\">What we do</a><a class=\"nav_link\" href=\"#portfolio\">The possibilities</a><a class=\"nav_link\" href=\"#process\">Our approach</a></div><a class=\"nav_button\" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Let’s talk <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></nav><button class=\"nav_hamburger\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-controls=\"primary-navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"line-asset\"></span><span class=\"line-asset\"></span></button></div></header>\n<main id=\"content\" class=\"main-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"pin-hero-stack\"><section class=\"section_home-header\" aria-labelledby=\"hero-title\"><div class=\"hero-mosaic\">\n<svg class=\"hero-shape-defs\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><clipPath id=\"hero-copy-shape\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path d=\"M .055 0 H .945 Q 1 0 .992 .09 L .955 .515 Q .95 .575 .89 .59 L .765 .62 Q .715 .63 .695 .705 L .64 .94 Q .625 1 .565 .99 L .05 .905 Q 0 .897 0 .83 V .07 Q 0 0 .055 0 Z\"/></clipPath><clipPath id=\"hero-photo-shape\" clipPathUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\"><path d=\"M .625 0 H .965 Q 1 0 1 .055 V .945 Q 1 1 .965 1 H .365 Q .328 1 .34 .94 L .412 .49 Q .42 .435 .47 .425 L .53 .41 Q .565 .4 .575 .335 L .605 .055 Q .61 0 .625 0 Z\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n<div class=\"hero-copy\"><h1 class=\"heading-1\" id=\"hero-title\">Make room for<br><span class=\"hero-highlight\">better living.</span><br>Every day.</h1><p class=\"hero-description body-3\">Thoughtful kitchens, bathrooms, and living spaces.<br>Designed around the way you live.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"button-primary \" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Plan your renovation<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></div></div>\n<figure class=\"hero-visual\"><img class=\"hero-photo\" src=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\" alt=\"Sunlit living room design concept with natural oak, a linen sofa, and garden views\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" fetchpriority=\"high\"><figcaption class=\"visually-hidden\">An original Tidewell Home interior design concept.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"hero-guide-card\"><div class=\"hero-guide-copy\"><p class=\"hero-guide-number\">3 spaces.</p><h2 class=\"title-1\">One thoughtful approach.</h2><div class=\"hero-guide-swatches\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><p class=\"caption-2\">Kitchens · Bathrooms · Whole homes</p><a class=\"hero-guide-link\" href=\"#services\">Find your starting point <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-sticker hero-sticker-square\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M11 35C3 15 22 6 39 8c2 17-8 35-28 27ZM11 35l18-18M21 25v-8M21 25h8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Made for<br>living.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hero-sticker hero-sticker-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Less excess.<br>More meaning.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hero-sticker hero-sticker-note\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Thoughtfully<br>Tidewell.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hero-sticker hero-sticker-pill\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>A little more you.</span></div>\n<div class=\"hero-sticker hero-sticker-triangle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 180 160\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M95 6c8-5 17-1 20 8l62 126c5 10-1 19-13 17L14 135C1 133-3 121 7 111L95 6Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span>Feel good.</span></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"section_home-benefits\" id=\"about\" aria-labelledby=\"benefits-title\"><img class=\"benefits-backdrop\" src=\"/images/tidewell-garden.webp\" alt=\"Original AI generated lifestyle scene of a couple enjoying a sunlit home garden\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"benefits-scrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"section-inner\"><div class=\"section-intro\"><h2 class=\"heading-2\" id=\"benefits-title\">Good spaces make<br>everyday life better.</h2><p class=\"body-3\">Thoughtful renovations for the way you live.<br>From your first ideas to your favourite everyday moments.</p></div><div class=\"benefits_content\"><article class=\"benefits_card\"><span class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21V10L16 3l11 7v11M11 27V16h10v11M3 27h26\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"title-1\">Bring people<br>together</h3><p class=\"body-3\">A kitchen for shared meals and the moments in between.</p><a class=\"benefit-link\" href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"0\">Explore kitchens<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></article><article class=\"benefits_card\"><span class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 25C1 10 16 2 28 4c2 12-6 27-21 21ZM7 25l14-14M14 18v-6M14 18h6\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"title-1\">Make room<br>to slow down</h3><p class=\"body-3\">A calmer bathroom. A little more space for yourself.</p><a class=\"benefit-link\" href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"1\">Explore bathrooms<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></article><article class=\"benefits_card\"><span class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 26h22M8 21l2-7L23 1l7 7-13 13-7 2M20 4l7 7\"/></svg></span><h3 class=\"title-1\">See the bigger<br>picture</h3><p class=\"body-3\">Thoughtful spaces for every chapter of your everyday.</p><a class=\"benefit-link\" href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"2\">Explore whole homes<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></article></div></div></section></div>\n<div class=\"pin-installation-stack\"><section class=\"pin-units section-inner\" id=\"services\" aria-labelledby=\"services-title\"><div class=\"section-kicker\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">01 / What we do</p><p class=\"caption-2\">One room, or a fresh perspective on it all.</p></div><div class=\"pin-unit-grid\"><div class=\"pin-unit-images\"><img data-unit-image src=\"/images/tidewell-kitchen.webp\" alt=\"Coastal kitchen concept with natural oak cabinets and a sage green island\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"  loading=\"lazy\"><img data-unit-image src=\"/images/tidewell-bathroom.webp\" alt=\"Bathroom concept with handmade green tiles, oak vanity, and warm plaster walls\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" hidden loading=\"lazy\"><img data-unit-image src=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\" alt=\"Light filled living room concept with a linen sofa, oak shelving, and garden doors\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" hidden loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"image-label caption-4\">DESIGN CONCEPT</span></div><div class=\"service-copy\"><h2 class=\"heading-2\" id=\"services-title\">Room for<br>something better.</h2><div class=\"pin-unit-options\"><button type=\"button\" data-unit-tab aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"service-description-0\"><small class=\"caption-4\">01 / Kitchen renovations</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Kitchens for coming together</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"service-description-0\" >Better flow, useful storage, and honest materials. A kitchen that works as beautifully on a Tuesday as it does when everyone comes over.</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-unit-tab aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"service-description-1\"><small class=\"caption-4\">02 / Bathroom renovations</small><strong class=\"title-1\">A quieter kind of bathroom</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"service-description-1\" hidden>Warm textures, thoughtful lighting, and a little space to slow down. Make an everyday routine feel like a moment for yourself.</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-unit-tab aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"service-description-2\"><small class=\"caption-4\">03 / Whole home renovations</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Your home, rethought</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"service-description-2\" hidden>See the bigger picture. Bring disconnected rooms together with a considered layout, a natural palette, and room for the way you actually live.</span></button></div><div class=\"pin-unit-playback\"><button class=\"pin-autoplay\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause slideshow</button></div></div></div><div class=\"pin-result\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A considered starting point</p><p class=\"title-1\">You bring the way you live.<br>We help you see what your home could be.</p><a class=\"button-primary \" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Let’s explore your space<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></div></section>\n<section class=\"pin-process\" id=\"process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">02 / Our approach</p><h2 class=\"heading-2\" id=\"process-title\">From “what if”<br>to “this feels right.”</h2><p class=\"body-3\">A collaborative process. A clearer direction.<br>One considered step at a time.</p><div class=\"pin-process-grid\"><div><button type=\"button\" data-process-tab aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"process-description-0\"><small class=\"caption-4\">STEP 01</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Start with your everyday</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"process-description-0\" >Tell us what works, what gets in the way, and what you imagine your home could become. We begin with listening.</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-process-tab aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"process-description-1\"><small class=\"caption-4\">STEP 02</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Find the right direction</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"process-description-1\" hidden>Explore layouts, materials, and a clear scope together. The aim is a plan that feels right for your home and your priorities.</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-process-tab aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"process-description-2\"><small class=\"caption-4\">STEP 03</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Bring the details together</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"process-description-2\" hidden>Refine the joinery, finishes, lighting, and practical details before the build begins. Good decisions deserve a little breathing room.</span></button><button type=\"button\" data-process-tab aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"process-description-3\"><small class=\"caption-4\">STEP 04</small><strong class=\"title-1\">Make yourself at home</strong><span class=\"body-3\" id=\"process-description-3\" hidden>Walk through the finished space, get to know its details, and settle into a home that feels like yours.</span></button><button class=\"pin-autoplay\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause slideshow</button></div><div class=\"pin-process-images\"><img data-process-image src=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\" alt=\"An inviting living room with natural light\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\"  loading=\"lazy\"><img data-process-image src=\"/images/tidewell-materials.webp\" alt=\"A palette of stone, green tile, linen, and oak samples\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" hidden loading=\"lazy\"><img data-process-image src=\"/images/tidewell-kitchen.webp\" alt=\"Oak and sage kitchen joinery concept\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" hidden loading=\"lazy\"><img data-process-image src=\"/images/tidewell-bathroom.webp\" alt=\"A considered bathroom with a handmade tile shower\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" hidden loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section></div>\n<section class=\"pin-stories\" id=\"portfolio\" aria-labelledby=\"gallery-title\"><div class=\"pin-stories-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">03 / The possibilities</p><h2 class=\"heading-2\" id=\"gallery-title\">A feeling worth<br>coming home to.</h2><p class=\"body-3\">Explore the textures, tones, and spaces behind our direction.</p></div><div class=\"pin-carousel-controls\"><button type=\"button\" data-story-direction=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous design concepts\">←</button><button type=\"button\" data-story-direction=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next design concepts\">→</button></div></div><div class=\"pin-story-track\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Design concept gallery\"><article class=\"concept-card\"><img src=\"/images/tidewell-kitchen.webp\" alt=\"The gathering kitchen, an AI generated interior design concept\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"caption-4\">CONCEPT 01</span><h3 class=\"title-1\">The gathering kitchen</h3><p class=\"caption-2\">Natural oak · Sage · Soft stone</p></div></article><article class=\"concept-card\"><img src=\"/images/tidewell-bathroom.webp\" alt=\"A slower morning, an AI generated interior design concept\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"caption-4\">CONCEPT 02</span><h3 class=\"title-1\">A slower morning</h3><p class=\"caption-2\">Handmade tile · Warm plaster</p></div></article><article class=\"concept-card\"><img src=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\" alt=\"Room to reconnect, an AI generated interior design concept\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"caption-4\">CONCEPT 03</span><h3 class=\"title-1\">Room to reconnect</h3><p class=\"caption-2\">Linen · Light · Open space</p></div></article><article class=\"concept-card\"><img src=\"/images/tidewell-materials.webp\" alt=\"The material edit, an AI generated interior design concept\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><span class=\"caption-4\">CONCEPT 04</span><h3 class=\"title-1\">The material edit</h3><p class=\"caption-2\">Thoughtful details · Lasting texture</p></div></article></div><p class=\"gallery-note caption-2\">Original AI generated design concepts, shown for inspiration.</p></section>\n<section class=\"pin-community\" aria-labelledby=\"philosophy-title\"><div class=\"community-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">The Tidewell way</p><h2 class=\"pin-word-reveal heading-1\" id=\"philosophy-title\">Less excess.<br>More meaning.</h2><p class=\"body-3\">A home does not need more of everything. It needs the right things, in the right places. Materials with character. Space to breathe. Details that make life a little easier.</p><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Tell us what home means to you <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"community-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg class=\"tidewell-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 25V14L24 5l16 9v11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"tidewell-wave\"><path d=\"M5 29c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0M5 38c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span class=\"caption-4\">CONSIDERED SPACES.<br>LASTING FEELING.</span></div></section>\n<section class=\"section_faqs section-inner\" id=\"faqs\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-heading\"><div class=\"faqs-content\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A little clarity</p><h2 class=\"heading-2\" id=\"faq-heading\">Before we begin.</h2><p class=\"body-3\">Your questions, thoughtfully answered.</p></div><div class=\"faqs_list\"><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Our services\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-0\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><span class=\"question-content\">What kinds of spaces do you renovate?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-0\" ><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">Our concept is built around kitchen, bathroom, and whole home renovations. Each begins with the way you use your space, then brings the layout, materials, and details together around that brief.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Your home\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-kitchen.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-1\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">Can I start with just one room?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-1\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">Yes. A single room can be a thoughtful place to begin. The initial conversation helps define what you want to change and whether any adjoining spaces or existing services need to be considered along the way.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Getting started\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-materials.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-2\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">What happens in the first conversation?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-2\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">We talk about your home, the things you would like to improve, your priorities, and any timing or budget considerations. A few photographs, a rough floor plan, or a collection of ideas can help tell the story. You do not need to have all the answers.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Planning\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-materials.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-3\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">How do you approach the budget?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-3\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">The scope and priorities come first. From there, materials, layout changes, and the level of detailing can be considered together. A project should have a defined scope and an agreed estimate before any building work is committed to.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Materials\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-kitchen.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-4\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-4\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">Can existing materials be part of the design?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-4\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">Absolutely. A beautiful floor, a well made cabinet, or a favourite piece of furniture can be the starting point for a room. The design process looks at what can be retained, repaired, or reworked before introducing something new.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Design\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-5\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">Do I need a finished design to begin?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-5\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">No. You can begin with a problem you want to solve, a feeling you want to create, or a folder of inspiration. The early design stages turn those starting points into a more coherent direction and a practical plan.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"The process\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-bathroom.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-6\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-6\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">How is the renovation timeline decided?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-6\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-6\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">Timing depends on the scope, design decisions, approvals, material availability, and the work involved. These factors should be reviewed together before a build programme is agreed. This concept site does not advertise a fixed turnaround.</p></div></article><article class=\"faqs_list-item\" data-topic=\"Our concepts\" data-image=\"/images/tidewell-living.webp\"><button class=\"dropdown_faqs-toggle\" type=\"button\" id=\"faq-question-7\" aria-controls=\"faq-answer-7\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"question-content\">Are the spaces shown completed client projects?</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button><div id=\"faq-answer-7\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-question-7\" hidden><p class=\"text-size-regular body-3\">The spaces on this site are original AI generated design concepts created to illustrate the Tidewell Home direction. They are not photographs of completed commissions, and no client results or testimonials are claimed.</p></div></article></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"contact-section\" id=\"contact\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">A good place to start</p><h2 class=\"heading-1\" id=\"contact-title\">Your next chapter<br>starts at home.</h2><p class=\"body-3\">A small idea. A room that never quite works.<br>Let’s see where a conversation could take it.</p><a class=\"button-primary \" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Plan your renovation<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a><span class=\"caption-2 contact-note\">A conversation before a commitment.</span></section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"footer\"><div class=\"footer-inner\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#content\" aria-label=\"Tidewell Home, back to top\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg class=\"tidewell-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 25V14L24 5l16 9v11\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><g class=\"tidewell-wave\"><path d=\"M5 29c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0M5 38c6-8 13-8 19 0s13 8 19 0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></g></svg><span>Tidewell<span class=\"brand-subtitle\">HOME</span></span></a><p class=\"body-3\">Thoughtful renovations, naturally. Create a home that feels good today and grows with your everyday.</p><a class=\"button-primary \" href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Start your project<span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span></a></div>\n<nav class=\"footer-column\" aria-label=\"Renovation services\"><h2 class=\"footer-heading\">Services</h2><a href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"0\">Kitchen renovations</a><a href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"1\">Bathroom renovations</a><a href=\"#services\" data-service-index=\"2\">Whole home renovations</a><a href=\"#process\">Project planning</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"footer-column\" aria-label=\"Studio information\"><h2 class=\"footer-heading\">The studio</h2><a href=\"#about\">About Tidewell</a><a href=\"#process\">Our approach</a><a href=\"#philosophy-title\">The Tidewell way</a><a href=\"#faqs\">Your questions</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"footer-column\" aria-label=\"Explore Tidewell\"><h2 class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</h2><a href=\"#portfolio\">Design concepts</a><a href=\"#services\">Find your space</a><a href=\"#contact\" data-open-dialog=\"Plan your renovation\">Start a conversation</a><a href=\"#privacy\" data-open-dialog=\"Privacy\">Your privacy</a></nav>\n<div class=\"footer-newsletter\"><h2 class=\"footer-heading\">The Tidewell notebook</h2><p class=\"caption-2\">A little inspiration, now and then.</p><form class=\"form-footer\"><label for=\"newsletter-email\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Your email address</label><input id=\"newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" aria-label=\"Your email address\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" required><button type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Prepare newsletter signup\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></button></form><p class=\"caption-2 footer-newsletter-note\">Materials, spaces, and ideas worth keeping.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"footer-bottom\"><p class=\"caption-2\">© 2026 Tidewell Home. An independent studio concept.</p><nav aria-label=\"Legal information\"><a href=\"#terms\" data-open-dialog=\"Terms\">Terms of use</a><a href=\"#privacy\" data-open-dialog=\"Privacy\">Privacy information</a><a href=\"#cookies\" data-open-dialog=\"Cookies\">Cookie information</a></nav></div></div>\n<figure class=\"footer-illustration\"><img class=\"footer-art\" src=\"/images/tidewell-footer.webp\" alt=\"Original painted illustration of a family looking toward a welcoming home, a garden path, and leafy trees\" width=\"2172\" height=\"724\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><div id=\"privacy\" hidden></div><div id=\"terms\" hidden></div><div id=\"cookies\" hidden></div></footer></div>",
